Description:

The iSchedule receiver now requires the Originator request header to match the
ORGANIZER of the scheduling message, or one of its ATTENDEEs for a REPLY, as
the (draft) spec requires.  A mismatch is refused with an originator-denied
error.  Delivered objects are now stored as the local recipient, with the
Originator recorded as the sender.


